 * Solution: Double-check the client ID in Azure Portal or using Azure CLI:
 * 
 * az identity show --name <identity-name> --resource-group <rg> --query clientId -o tsv
 */

/**
 * PITFALL #2: Identity not assigned to the Azure resource
 * Solution: Assign the user-assigned identity to your resource:
 * 
 * For App Service:
 * az webapp identity assign \
 *   --name <app-name> \
 *   --resource-group <rg> \
